Transitions for each num x: add x to a subsequence of even length (x gets + sign) or odd length (x gets - sign), updating sum and product; if product exceeds limit, skip. Zeros are handled by allowing product 0 once the subsequence contains a zero (once product is 0, it stays 0, so I track it as a special value).

